sequenceDiagram
    participant WX as bridge
    participant App as BotApplication
    participant In as ingress
    participant M as MemberStore/History
    participant R as Maintenance
    participant P as Plugins
    participant S as ServiceFacade

    Note over WX,S: 本文件为完整顺序源；docs/images/message-flow-3.png 是省略维护分流与人格兼容步骤的主链路图。

    WX->>App: message
    App->>In: submit
    In->>R: owner DM? maintenance queue
    In->>In: chat_allowlist filter
    In->>P: capture
    In->>M: record
    M-->>In: inserted?
    In->>App: notify learner
    In->>M: prepare_reset
    In->>R: group maintenance command?
    In->>P: prepare_switch
    In->>P: dispatch
    P->>M: snapshot
    P->>S: send_text(delivery_guard)
    S->>S: validate session / wait pacing / re-check guard
    S->>WX: send

    Note over In,P: capture before record
